:name: S.T.A.R. AOS frame check on a simulated STM32F4 Discovery (Cortex-M4)
:description: loads star_aos_fw.elf, logs USART2 to a file, runs for 2 s of virtual time, then quits

mach create "stm32f4"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/stm32f4_discovery-kit.repl
sysbus LoadELF $elf
usart2 CreateFileBackend $out true
emulation RunFor "2"
quit
